{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_041fuk_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_041fuk_2001_041fuk", "source_sha256": "37cd3168a9a71f6ae9002f58590541149eaa06f749a1591645a7f1bd83885591", "ja": "{$P$}さんっ、大変です……！", "zh": "{$P$}先生，不好了……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_041fuk_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_041fuk_2002_041fuk", "source_sha256": "80410512541e5a746bf134c5fd5860834f9fd04b246a14e17394df94a16795b1", "ja": "キャンペーン用の衣装が、ちょっと小さいんです！\n上半身が、その、パツパツになっちゃって……。", "zh": "宣传活动用的服装有点太小了！\n上半身，那个，绷得紧紧的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_041fuk_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_041fuk_2003_p", "source_sha256": "5b4cfaccc4691601c3b72a24bcb248a3a358925fb1afe896f9ee527b4506d467", "ja": "なんだって？　おかしいな、サイズは事前に提出して\nピッタリに作ってもらったはずなのに……。", "zh": "你说什么？真奇怪，我们明明就事先提供了尺寸，\n请对方据此做出合身的服装才对……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_041fuk_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_041fuk_2004_041fuk", "source_sha256": "00feada1e798209ff4fc9fec67e43e5b37af5f58003eed017fbc687d9fd77007", "ja": "えっ？　あのアンケートって、\nそのためのものだったんですか……？", "zh": "咦？那份问卷\n原来是这样的用途吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_041fuk_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_041fuk_2005_p", "source_sha256": "664e910da36e525e18d250ce7a956e556624dd81e31ee5e1377825905b2d4dbd", "ja": "風花……もしかして……。", "zh": "风花……你该不会……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_041fuk_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_041fuk_2006_041fuk", "source_sha256": "0fc73af1a732c92ffd9dd7f65686cc002587c32ca7a24d541e2692c6c05ac4dd", "ja": "うう……。す、すみませ～ん……！\nわざと、サイズを小さく書いちゃいました……。", "zh": "呜呜……对、对不起……！\n我故意把尺寸写小了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_041fuk_2000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_041fuk_2007_p", "source_sha256": "bbbc4e923f7f65f353078c86a9ff21223b69b454b5bda1d90c0996ce24bb151f", "ja": "（仕方なく、風花はパツパツな衣装のままイベントを\n行い……キャンペーンは、大成功を収めた）", "zh": "（无可奈何之下，风花穿着紧绷的服装进行了\n活动……宣传活动以大成功落幕。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
